(374, 'Beldum', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/374.png', 3, 3, COMMON, 1, 13, 248, NULL, 106, 'Instead of blood, a powerful magnetic force courses throughout BELDUM''s body. This Pokemon communicates with others by sending controlled pulses of magnetism.', 'Iron Ball Pokemon', 95.2, 0.6, 40, 55, 80, 35, 60, 30),
(375, 'Metang', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/375.png', 3, 3, COMMON, 1, 13, 248, NULL, 106, 'When two BELDUM fuse together, METANG is formed. The brains of the BELDUM are joined by a magnetic nervous system. By linking its brains magnetically, this Pokemon generates strong psychokinetic power.', 'Iron Claw Pokemon', 202.5, 1.2, 60, 75, 100, 55, 80, 50),
(376, 'Metagross', 'https://raw.githubusercontent.com/PokeAPI/sprites/master/sprites/pokemon/376.png', 3, 3, COMMON, 1, 13, 248, NULL, 106, 'METAGROSS has four brains in total. Combined, the four brains can breeze through difficult calculations faster than a supercomputer. This Pokemon can float in the air by tucking in its four legs.', 'Iron Leg Pokemon', 550.0, 1.6, 80, 135, 130, 95, 90, 70),
